#!markdown

# 04 · RNA-seq differential expression

**EN** — Simulate a small count matrix, run DESeq2-style differential expression, and explore the result with a table, volcano plot, MA plot, PCA and a clustered heatmap of the top genes.

**ID** — Mensimulasikan matriks hitungan kecil, menjalankan analisis ekspresi diferensial ala DESeq2, lalu menelusuri hasilnya dengan tabel, volcano plot, MA plot, PCA, dan heatmap terklaster untuk gen teratas.

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.2.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Core;
using Biotech.Net.Transcriptomics;
using Biotech.Net.Visualization;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();

#!markdown

## Simulated counts · Hitungan simulasi

1,000 genes × 8 samples (4 control, 4 treated); the first 60 genes respond to treatment.
1.000 gen × 8 sampel (4 kontrol, 4 perlakuan); 60 gen pertama merespons perlakuan.

#!csharp

var rng = new Random(42);
int genes = 1000, samples = 8;
var values = new double[genes * samples];
for (int g = 0; g < genes; g++)
{
    double mean = Math.Exp(2 + rng.NextDouble() * 6);
    double fold = g < 30 ? 4 : g < 60 ? 0.25 : 1;
    for (int s = 0; s < samples; s++)
    {
        double mu = mean * (s >= 4 ? fold : 1);
        // Gamma-Poisson-ish noise · derau mirip Gamma-Poisson
        double noisy = mu * Math.Exp(0.25 * (rng.NextDouble() + rng.NextDouble() + rng.NextDouble() - 1.5));
        values[g * samples + s] = Math.Round(noisy);
    }
}
var counts = new Dataset("counts",
    Enumerable.Range(1, genes).Select(i => $"gene{i:D4}").ToArray(),
    ["ctl1", "ctl2", "ctl3", "ctl4", "trt1", "trt2", "trt3", "trt4"], values);
counts.Annotate("condition", "ctl", "ctl", "ctl", "ctl", "trt", "trt", "trt", "trt");
counts

#!markdown

## DESeq2 Wald test · Uji Wald DESeq2

#!csharp

var result = DESeq.Run(counts, "condition", "ctl", "trt");
result

#!csharp

new VolcanoPlot(result) { LabelTop = 8, FoldChangeThreshold = 1 }

#!csharp

new MaPlot(result)

#!markdown

## PCA of variance-stabilised counts · PCA dari hitungan yang distabilkan variansnya

#!csharp

var vst = Transforms.Vst(counts);
var pca = Pca.Fit(DenseMatrix.FromDataset(vst, transpose: true), components: 4);
EmbeddingPlot.FromPca(pca, counts.ColumnAnnotations["condition"], counts.ColumnNames)

#!markdown

## Heatmap of the top genes · Heatmap gen teratas

#!csharp

var top = result.Top(40).Select(r => vst.RowIndex(r.Gene)).ToArray();
var heat = Heatmap.FromDataset(vst.SelectRows(top, "top 40 genes (VST, z-score)"));
heat

#!csharp

// Interactive Plotly version, or a high-DPI PNG for a report · versi interaktif atau PNG untuk laporan
heat.Save("top-genes.html");
File.WriteAllBytes("top-genes.png", heat.ToPng(scale: 2));
